  "id": "circuit-board",
  "label": "Circuit board",
  "intent": "Current runs through the circuit board. Light: the current enters each trace at the board's edge and runs along it to its pad, one trace after another, and each pad flashes as the current reaches it. Strong: two pulses run through the traces in turn, the second faster, and the pads flash twice, the second time bigger. The board never moves.",
  "parts": {
